do
    local home = Tabs.Home:AddLeftGroupbox('welcome');
    home:AddParagraph("Welcome to ToneQR.EZ - we're glad you're here.", "ToneQR.EZ didn't come from nothing - it was built on the foundation laid by UE, KiciaHook, Illusionary, and Elysium, each one leaving its mark on the scripting philosophy, the execution style, and the attention to detail that runs through the hub's core. The functionality was forged by studying how those scripts handled their logic, their hooks, and their commitment to actually working when it mattered. On the visual side, the GUI pulls its soul directly from tanqr's design language - clean, sharp, and built to feel like something real rather than something rushed. ToneQR.EZ is the product of that lineage, carried forward and refined into something that stands on its own. Under the hood, this hub was made with the help of a little AI and built on open source - because the best tools are the ones the community can see, trust, and grow. We hope every time you load it up, you feel the work that went into it. Enjoy the hub, enjoy the game, and enjoy what we built for you.");
